# Environment files (all names, not just the exact `.env`)
# NOTE: `.env`, `.env.local` ... only match those exact names.
# A Chinese-named file like `环境变量配置说明.env`
# does NOT match them, so keys filled into it would be committed. `*.env` covers all.
*.env
